    "attributes": {
        "action": "Increase UK support for climate adaptation to disaster vulnerable  country Nepal",
        "additional_details": "Nepal contributes only around 0.05% of today's global CO\u2082 emissions and just 0.01% of historical cumulative CO\u2082 emissions,yet suffers such catastrophic climate change consequences.What Nepal needs from UK are \r\n1.\tIncrease and protect UK funding for climate adaptation and disaster resilience for NEPAL.\r\n2.\tExpand investment in early warning systems\r\n3.\tEnsure climate-vulnerable countries can access timely and adequate adaptation.",
        "background": "Increase UK funding for climate adaptation, disaster resilience, infrastructure, essential services and emergency response.\r\nInvest in early warning systems,glacier,river monitoring, data sharing, community alerts, evacuation plans and training.\r\nEnsure Nepal does not take on more debt.",
